# installation_process.md

## Purpose

Defines the standard installation workflow.

## Installation Flow

### 01 — Pre-Installation

Confirm:

* Product received
* Product inspected
* Vehicle identified
* Required components available
* Installation requirements understood
* Appointment confirmed

### 02 — Installation

Record:

* Installation start
* Installer
* Products installed
* Issues encountered
* Additional work required

### 03 — Fitment

Check:

* Alignment
* Fit
* Panel gaps
* Mounting
* Finish
* Function where relevant

### 04 — Quality Control

Confirm the vehicle meets the agreed project requirements.

### 05 — Completion

Record:

* Installation completion
* Final photos
* Customer handover
* Outstanding items
* Warranty / after-sales information if applicable

## Installation Status

* Not Scheduled
* Scheduled
* In Progress
* Fitment / QC
* Completed
* Requires Follow-up

## Important Rule

Installation capability is product-specific.

Do not assume every Revtek product can be installed using the same process.

